        },
        {
          "field": "original_name",
          "value": "A Bird Story",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "A Bird Story is a simple, surreal short about a boy and a bird with a broken wing. Its sole purpose is to tell a story, and can be viewed as a narrative/animation with interactivity -- but without a line of dialogue. It is a standalone game with its own beginning and endings; but for those who's played To the Moon, the boy eventually grows up to become the next patient in the series.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "A Bird Story es un cortometraje sencillo y surrealista sobre un niño y un pájaro con un ala rota. Su único propósito es contar una historia, y puede verse como una narrativa animada con interactividad, pero sin una sola línea de diálogo. Es un juego independiente, con su propio comienzo y final; sin embargo, para quienes hayan jugado a To the Moon, el niño acaba creciendo y se convierte en el siguiente paciente de la serie.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2014",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
      ],
